Let <MATH_0001> be a category.\nThe only <MATH_0002>-morphisms between categories fibred in sets are identities.\nIn other words, the <MATH_0003>-category of categories fibred in sets is a category.\nMoreover, there is an equivalence of categories\n<MATH_0004>\nThe functor from left to right is the construction\n<MATH_0005> discussed in\nExample <REF_0001>.\nThe functor from right to left assigns to <MATH_0006>\nthe presheaf of objects <MATH_0007>.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a178ac86fb5b00c3deda07c3aac33a5e51a15b8d56d82d7d8c8da434dcd7cc8d", "unit_id": "inventory:categories:02Y2:lemma/0001"}, "state": "BLOCKED"}}, "model_output": {"hash": "sha256:09445665c2e8b3d3e575976e221fc4b33a59b88999b16fa32aeb9a4fe6a41b5b", "path": "docs/evidence/categories-completion-p016-retry-raw.jsonl", "record_hash": "sha256:f400db36be7299f400bd65c734708cc614abd6ab52a95a0f66d822fcb491cce0"}, "neighbor_unit_ids": [], "policy_revision": "git:e7a1627e7bce13592b8c07d43974a815ba27c0d5", "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "read_context": {"citations": [], "neighbors": [{"context_id": "inventory:categories:0042:paragraph/0004", "relation": "before"}, {"context_id": "inventory:categories:0042:paragraph/0005", "relation": "after"}], "references": [{"context_id": "reference:categories-example-hom-functor", "label": "example-hom-functor"}, {"context_id": "reference:categories-example-category-over-X", "label": "example-category-over-X"}, {"context_id": "reference:categories-lemma-2-category-fibred-sets", "label": "lemma-2-category-fibred-sets"}, {"context_id": "reference:categories-example-presheaf", "label": "example-presheaf"}], "unit_id": "tag:0044:statement"}, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_required_terms": {"catalog_hash": "sha256:899a668e50f3487b37dd8781e9b5a88e3e16d272ad91b4078ac6b9d847935c12", "occurrences": [{"concept": "category", "projection_end": 29, "projection_start": 21, "rule": "catalog", "source_term": "category"}, {"concept": "r